WEBVTT

00:04:54.944 --> 00:05:00.374
that brought schools and universities 
and research centers all together.

00:05:00.374 --> 00:05:03.414
And what you mentioned before 
about the partnerships

00:05:03.414 --> 00:05:06.219
with top-level colleges and universities

00:05:06.569 --> 00:05:10.029
translates actually 
into specific universities

00:05:10.029 --> 00:05:13.669
that are at the top 
of the rankings around the world,

00:05:14.468 --> 00:05:19.508
opening up faculties and departments
within Education City.

00:05:19.508 --> 00:05:23.128
I remember, for example,
some American universities

00:05:23.128 --> 00:05:26.968
running the Engineering Department,

00:05:27.448 --> 00:05:31.158
so that's the way it is developed.